			title: "MV Steam Turbine"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["262640F3533EE2C3"]
			description: [
				"Ruby, the same deep redstone vein steam age taught you to drill, splits in the electrolyzer into chromium and aluminium."
				"A second road to aluminium: bauxite from the mica vein, electrolyzed at MV power."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:chromium_ingot"
			id: "3EB82BACA3DFF6DB"
			rewards: [{ id: "2CADAAFB5EDA183C", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [
				{ count: 4L, id: "0D9122DA72BB797F", item: "gtceu:chromium_ingot", type: "item" }
				{ count: 4L, id: "47222F0CFA9330D0", item: "gtceu:aluminium_ingot", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Chromium and Aluminium"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3EB82BACA3DFF6DB"]
			description: [
				"Iron, aluminium and chromium melt together in the Kanthal EBF. Two MV energy hatches now, not one, to reach the 480 EU/t Kanthal needs. A chemical bath and a wiremill turn the ingot into coil wire."
				"&6Kanthal Coil Blocks&r push the blast furnace to an even higher heat. That is what silicon needs next, and what stainless steel needs too."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:kanthal_coil_block"
			id: "5DC39DF3C1563B6B"
			rewards: [{ id: "5C6DDC6FFEF5B6E3", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "0928209E9F6A03E3", item: "gtceu:kanthal_coil_block", type: "item" }]
			title: "Kanthal"
			x: 12.5d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5DC39DF3C1563B6B"]
			description: [
				"Vanadium, chromium and seven parts steel smelt into &6Vanadium Steel&r. The only metal hard enough for the cutter's saw and the vein drill's new bit."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:vanadium_steel_ingot"
			id: "74057E6BDC378944"
			rewards: [{ id: "41D73766281A9B27", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
