		{
			dependencies: ["3FCAFC1E38DD934C"]
			description: [
				"Same family as the LV drill, same vein table, same sample, just more bores per hatch and a vanadium steel bit instead of steel."
				"Everything the LV drill could reach, this one reaches faster, and it is the drill for the End veins."
