		{
			dependencies: ["430CFDDFCF9174C1"]
			description: [
				"The drill pays for its own bit: vanadium steel from the same veins the ore plant is already processing."
				"It wears out slower than the steel bit ever did, and drilling fluid cuts that wear again."
