		{
			dependencies: ["3FCAFC1E38DD934C"]
			description: [
				"Stone dust stops being pure waste: the centrifuge now splits it into quartzite, feldspar, marble, biotite and sodalite."
				"What is left over is a mixed metal residue, not worth separating yet. Keep it in a drawer. EV will want it."
