		{
			dependencies: ["30D3D68203F455F9"]
			description: [
				"Same spec as the LV greenhouse, more bores per hatch. A carbon dioxide line is new: feed it in and every recipe yields half again as much, and gives back oxygen for the EBF."
				"Logs, rubber resin and crops: everything pyrolysis, the brewery and the biorefinery are about to ask for."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:mv_greenhouse"
