			title: "Biorefinery"
			x: 30.0d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["30D3D68203F455F9"]
			description: [
				"GTM's own &6Fluid Drilling Rig&r prospects and drills oil, gas and brine on its own. The vein never runs dry, in the Overworld or in the Flatlands and Void alike, so one trip under the base is all you need."
				"Four frames, four circuits, four motors, four pumps and four vanadium steel gears: the first machine that asks for every line in this chapter at once."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:mv_fluid_drilling_rig"
			id: "1A38798F23E8EA97"
			rewards: [{ id: "58FE1CD5AD9C17E5", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "0721BC67872504EC", item: "gtceu:mv_fluid_drilling_rig", type: "item" }]
			title: "MV Fluid Drilling Rig"
			x: 22.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1A38798F23E8EA97"]
			description: [
				"Crude splits into fractions in the distillery; strip the sulfur out with hydrogen and the mixer turns the rest into diesel."
				"No oil under the base? Seed oil and methanol make biodiesel instead: slower, but it runs the same generators."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:mv_distillery"
			id: "44031073B1E3A181"
			rewards: [{ id: "7509CCC2EB6D0716", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
