			title: "Diesel"
			x: 25.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4A6B8F971E17C847"]
			description: [
				"Salt water from the fluid rig's brine deposit, or salt and water in a mixer if you are landlocked, electrolyzes at LV power into sodium hydroxide, chlorine and hydrogen."
				"All three get used again before this chapter ends: sodium hydroxide becomes persulfate, chlorine becomes PVC, hydrogen becomes methanol."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_electrolyzer"
			id: "498077C9A58D9578"
			rewards: [{ id: "609D15E06779863F", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "2061C5FD9F9B9C7B", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Brine and Chlorine"
			x: 30.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["498077C9A58D9578"]
			description: [
				"Ethanol and sulfuric acid make ethylene; ethylene alone makes polyethylene. The transistor two steps from now is waiting on this plastic."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_chemical_reactor"
